# online_four_machine_offline_packings_verified

Topic: online_algorithms   Node: a9f0e98b7bd7

Provenance: helper lemma. Offline packing certificates for the adaptive four-machine adversary in arXiv:2611.10440, Theorem 2.

The recorded list has 124 job-prefix packing certificates. Every certificate has exactly four bins, the multiset of jobs in the bins is the indicated prefix, and every bin load is at most the indicated capacity. This statement checks the packings only; it does not assert that they cover all online branches.
-/

